    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Brainwashing Academy - The Cursed Person's Pot&quot; is an RPG game produced by U-ROOM and published by Hanabi games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist acquires a mysterious curse from an enigmatic man,<br>along with a mission\u2014to infiltrate a school with the man's niece<br>and bring the student council president to ruin through the power of the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Will you indulge your desires and unleash the curse to corrupt the school\u2026<br>\u25b3 Or will you uncover the mysteries hidden within and seek out the truth behind the school\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jrpg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating story</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings and Story Branches</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based Combat</p></li></ul>",
